1.0.9 24/10/2013
Added password reset requirement at 3 month intervals. Password is now also randomly generated at user creation.
Email now sent to user with initial credentials.
Changed from group to role-based access (roles consist of multiple groups). Roles are applied to user during creation or editing
New controllers added to deal with AJAX-based calculations and timeline image generation.
Calculation logic improved, the framework now determines which fields trigger recalculation.
Added RecalculateButton component which provides a 'Recalculate' button if there are any calculations in the page.
Change add.css to fix problem with date pickers displaying over option buttons.
Use jQuery to hide 'clear..' options for fields when shown in modal as view only.
Cleaner field validation through single JS function.
Improved domain options display to provide collapsible sections
Updated ModuleLoad and associated classes to provide transaction support for form loading and form and report validation

